    <briefdescription>
<para>Match a specified integer value or vector of all elements of that value. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><computeroutput>BitWidth</computeroutput> optionally specifies the bitwidth the matched constant must have. If it is 0, the matched constant can have any bitwidth. </para>
